        (a) If k is odd, we have:        (a) If k is even, we have:
               y =         (01)(1)k (01)        y     =       (01)(1)k (01)
                 1             k−1                1
               y    = (01)(1) (0)(01)           y     = (01)(1)k−2 (00)(01)
               y 2 = (01)(1)k−3 (000)(01)       y 2 = (01)(1)k−4 (0000)(01)
                     ..                               ..
                      .                                .
                k                                     k
              y⌊ 2 ⌋ =   (01)(11)(0)k−2 (01)        y2 =        (01)(11)(0)k−2 (01)
