(j + 1) + k < n and j + (k + 1) < n, resp.
Remark 1. Note that cycles O(n) can also be found with block sequential
configurations with (at least) two groups of size two or more consecutive cells
that update on the same substep.
Lemma 19. w = 0011 is a relative wall for ECA rule 184.
