Rule 54
   Rule (54, seq) shows a completely stable behavior, identical to (150, seq),
but for update modes under all other categories its behavior is more similar
to ones seen under rule 110, as we can see on Fig. 24 using (54, bp) as an
example. Note that it has a much more wider range of values around which
both density and energy stabilize compared to rule (110, lc).

